
📤Main Focuses of Box:
1. SMB Enumeration & Misconfigurations: Discovering and accessing a poorly secured backup network share that allowed unauthorized read access to sensitive system files.  
2. Credential Harvesting: Extracting the SAM and SYSTEM registry files and using Impacket to dump local NTLM password hashes.  
3. Offline Password Cracking: Utilizing John the Ripper alongside the rockyou.txt wordlist to crack the dumped hash and reveal the plaintext password.  
4. Remote Desktop Access: Leveraging the cracked plaintext credentials to establish a graphical session via RDP (xfreerdp) and navigate the host environment.
